: discover-capture-layer
:
: VK_ADD_IMPLICIT_LAYER_PATH is set for the duration of this one invocation
: only (Testscript env, hermetic, so it does not pick up any
: system-registered RenderDoc install), from $layer_dir (buildfile
: variable, see ./buildfile). VK_ADD_LAYER_PATH only affects explicit
: layers, not implicit ones like this capture layer.
: ENABLE_VULKAN_RENDERDOC_CAPTURE is the manifest's own activation gate
: (VULKAN_ENABLE_VAR), which enumeration does not actually require, but it
: is set anyway to exercise the manifest as actually written.
:
env VK_ADD_IMPLICIT_LAYER_PATH=$layer_dir ENABLE_VULKAN_RENDERDOC_CAPTURE=1 -- $*
